# Øvre Dividal national park, Troms: gentle tundra valleys and fells on the
# Swedish border, with very few people. Its official extent
# (Miljødirektoratet's protected-area register). EPSG:25833 metres, on the
# 2 km tile grid (414 tiles).
WEST=670000
SOUTH=7612000
EAST=716000
